{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04495","headline":"还至张掖古城闻东军告捷赠韦五虚己 · 陈子昂","name":"还至张掖古城闻东军告捷赠韦五虚己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟秋首归路，仲月旅边亭。\n闻道兰山战，相邀在井陉。\n屡鬬关月满，三捷虏云平。\n汉军追北地，胡骑走南庭。\n君爲幕中士，畴昔好言兵。\n白虎锋应出，青龙阵几成。\n披图见丞相，按节入咸京。\n宁知玉门道，翻作陇西行。\n北海朱旄落，东归白露生。\n纵横未得意，寂寞寡相迎。\n负劒空叹息，苍茫登古城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}